        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: கோளாறு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கோளாறு — kōḷāṟu — \"a fault; a malfunction\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இயந்திரத்தில் ஏதோ கோளாறு இருக்கிறது. iyantirattil ētō kōḷāṟu irukkiṟatu. There is some fault in the engine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of the body too: வயிற்றுக் கோளாறு (kōḷāṟu), a stomach upset."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கோளாறு (kōḷāṟu), \"a fault, a disorder\", is an everyday Tamil word whose origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
